flowchart LR
  U[Administrator or Operator] --> B[Browser]
  B --> P[InterSystems Management Portal Frontend]
  P -->|HTTPS requests| G{Same-origin app path or reverse proxy / CORS}
  G --> A[SysAdmin API v2]
  A --> I[InterSystems IRIS or IRIS for Health]

  P --> V[Verified domains]
  V --> V1[Authentication]
  V --> V2[System information]
  V --> V3[Jobs]
  V --> V4[Packages]

  P --> Q[Pending endpoint verification]
  Q --> Q1[Web apps and REST APIs]
  Q --> Q2[Permissions]
  Q --> Q3[Security and secrets]
  Q --> Q4[Tasks]
  Q --> Q5[OS management]
  Q --> Q6[Logs]

  P --> S[Session handling]
  S --> S1[Access token in memory]
  S --> S2[Refresh token in memory]
  S --> S3[UI preferences in window.name]